# Commit messages

When creating a commit or pushing, write the message only. Do not append a Cursor author trailer.

## Forbidden in commit messages

Never add this line or any variant of it:

```
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

Variants include different capitalization, spacing, display names, or the same email address. Do not pass it with `git commit --trailer`, `git interpret-trailers`, or a later `git commit --amend`. Do not add it while pushing.
